From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Haze <patches@haze.invalid>
Date: Fri, 27 Nov 2026 14:04:10 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] Let Haze's code use Blink's public common headers

Why: //third_party/blink/public/common:headers is visible only to a fixed list
of directories, and //haze is not on it. Haze needs it for the WebRTC policy
names its default prefs use and for Blink's feature declarations in its tests.
This touches third_party/blink only to add //haze/* to that visibility list.
Security-relevant: no
Area: core
---
 third_party/blink/public/common/BUILD.gn | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/third_party/blink/public/common/BUILD.gn b/third_party/blink/public/common/BUILD.gn
index cada4d7..443d629 100644
--- a/third_party/blink/public/common/BUILD.gn
+++ b/third_party/blink/public/common/BUILD.gn
@@ -112,6 +112,7 @@ source_set("headers") {
     "//components/*",
     "//content/*",
     "//fuchsia/*",
+    "//haze/*",
     "//pdf/*",
     "//printing/*",
     "//services/*",
